<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>404 - Không tìm thấy trang</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Roboto:wght@300;400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.7.1/css/all.min.css">
    <link href="/css/admin-modern.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body {
            background-color: var(--gray-50);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
            font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;
        }

        .error-container {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2rem;
            max-width: 500px;
        }

        .error-code {
            font-size: 8rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--primary-green);
            line-height: 1;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            text-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(76, 175, 80, 0.2);
        }

        .error-title {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--gray-900);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .error-message {
            color: var(--gray-600);
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .home-btn {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.75rem;
            background: var(--primary-green);
            color: white;
            padding: 0.75rem 2rem;
            border-radius: 99px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: all 0.2s;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(76, 175, 80, 0.3);
        }

        .home-btn:hover {
            background: var(--primary-green-dark, #43a047);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 8px -1px rgba(76, 175, 80, 0.4);
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="error-container">
        <div class="error-code">404</div>
        <h1 class="error-title">Oops! Trang không tồn tại</h1>
        <p class="error-message">
            Trang bạn đang tìm kiếm có thể đã bị xóa, đổi tên hoặc tạm thời không truy cập được.
        </p>
        <a href="/admin/dashboard" class="home-btn">
            <i class="fas fa-home"></i> Trở về Dashboard
        </a>
    </div>
</body>

</html>